[[2047,127,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the safety instructions\n(\n                                                         <a href=\"#/3238304\">5040A</a>\n                                                          - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Drain the coolant \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a>\n                                           see\nop.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238323\">5040A80</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the bolt.</p><p>2. Remove the expansion valve (2a) and keep the plate (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018486.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the expansion valve is not damaged\nor obstructed.</p><p>Reposition the plate and the expansion\nvalve.</p><p>Tighten the bolt.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238323\">5040A80</a></p><p>Repressurize the coolant \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a></p>"],[2047,96,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238852\">7040L37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238342\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238792\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238501\">5560C51</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238256\">5010C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238254\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238799\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238800\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238801\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238788\">7040A09</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem follow the safety instructions for working on the system carefully\n(). (\n                                                               <a href=\"#/3238524\">5580C</a>\n                                                                )</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/3238528\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238460\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238502\">5560C60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238496\">5560B02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238497\">5560B03</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238476\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238789\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238331\">5040C12</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the shield for the expansion valve.</p><p>2. Remove the shield.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018487.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,16,"<p>1. Unscrew the nuts.</p><p>2. Remove the pipe connector.</p><p>3. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>4. Remove the expansion valve.</p><p>5. Recover the gaskets.</p><p>Do not reuse the seals when refitting.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018488.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the expansion valve is not damaged.</p><p>Position the new gaskets on the expansion\nvalve, then secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Position the pipe connector and secure\nit using the nuts.</p><p>Position the shield and fix it using the\nbolts</p><p><a href=\"#/3238331\">5040C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238789\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238476\">5550A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238793\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238121\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238527\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238497\">5560B03</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238496\">5560B02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238502\">5560C60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238460\">5540C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238528\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238788\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238801\">7040A45</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238800\">7040A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238799\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238254\">5010C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238256\">5010C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238501\">5560C51</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238792\">7040A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238342\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238852\">7040L37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p>"]]